WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.200
Start a new empty notebook. (3× speed)

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.169
Upload the workshop book as the source. (3× speed)

00:00:01.169 --> 00:00:02.196
Upload the workshop book. (3× speed)

00:00:02.196 --> 00:00:02.315
Show how source selection controls the question scope.

00:00:02.315 --> 00:00:03.634
Deselect the book to show the source scope

00:00:03.634 --> 00:00:06.148
Select the book as the sole source

00:00:06.148 --> 00:00:06.505
Widen the question and result. (3× speed)

00:00:06.505 --> 00:00:07.986
Write the source-grounded request. (3× speed)

00:00:07.986 --> 00:00:10.094
Read the complete request.

00:00:10.094 --> 00:00:10.443
Send the question with the selected book. (3× speed)

00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:10.987
Generate the answer from the selected source. (4× speed)

00:00:10.987 --> 00:00:14.672
Read the answer before checking the original source.

00:00:14.672 --> 00:00:22.141
Check the cited statement in the original chapter.

00:00:22.141 --> 00:00:24.400
Export the checked source-grounded answer.
